From 71842c74058a69af0188f3737ce18803ab9e283e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Navid Ghahremani <ghahramani.navid@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:26:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] econet: add EN751627 switch/NAND support and Zyxel EX3301-T0

Add support for the EcoNet EN751627 SoC and the Zyxel EX3301-T0:
- Integrated switch and Gigabit Ethernet ports (lan1-lan4, wan)
- MDIO MediaTek PHY driver integration and LED control
- SPI-NAND JFFS2 overlay persistence across reboots
- Dual-slot bootloader integration (tclinux.trx, RAS.bin) and OpenWrt sysupgrade

Signed-off-by: Navid Ghahremani <ghahramani.navid@gmail.com>
