+++ b/target/linux/econet/patches-6.18/916-net-dsa-mt7530-add-en751627-support.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,113 @@
+From: local
+Subject: net: dsa: mt7530: add EN751627 support
+
+UNTESTED / locally authored, not upstream. Mirrors 781-...-add-en7528-support.patch
+exactly (same switch core, same MMIO glue, same reset sequence and PHY indirect
+access registers), with one real difference: on the Zyxel EX3301-T0 (EN751627),
+all five user ports (0-4) are wired out to physical jacks, not just 1-4 like the
+EN7528 boards this was modeled on. Port 0 is a real, working LAN port on this
