+From: local
+Subject: net: phy: mediatek: accept MT7988-ID PHYs wired at MDIO address 8-12 and fix LED polarity and blinking
+
+Widen mt7988_phy_probe()'s address acceptance to also cover MDIO addresses 8-12
+(used on EN751627 SoC), map to normalized 0-4 index in shared priv array,
+enable LED BCR clock, mode, and external control (0x8009), configure on and
+blink durations (0x0c00, 0x1400), initialize active-low polarity and set
+hardware link/activity rules.
